---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Ceiling Water Stains Wake Forest NC | Roof Leak Signs" description="Ceiling water stains in Wake Forest often mean a roof or flashing leak. Fast diagnosis and repair. Call (919) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Water Stains</div>
      <h1>Ceiling Water Stains</h1>
      <p>Brown rings or discoloration on ceilings are classic early signs of a roof or penetration leak.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Catching stains early prevents mold, damaged drywall, and saturated insulation. We trace the path upward, repair the roof source, and can advise on interior remediation if needed.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
